## The Solution

### We solved this by treating the label as a piece of architectural design:

**The Grid System:** We implemented a strict, multi-column grid. Compliance data (nutrition facts, manufacturing info) was compartmentalized into clean, left-aligned structural boxes. This freed up the center and right panels for brand storytelling.

**Color as Navigation:** We developed an earthy color-coding system—Forest Green for Amlaprash, Rose Pink for Gulkand, and Mustard Gold for Ghee. This creates immediate product distinction on the shelf while maintaining family unity.

**Heritage Illustrations:** To elevate the premium feel, we moved away from generic stock photography. Instead, we crafted bespoke, flat-vector illustrations depicting the traditional sourcing methods (e.g., the Bilona churning process, hand-picking Damas roses). These visuals instantly communicate authenticity and artisanal care.

